<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Swedish bank basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Swedish bank basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued a total of five million American-style call warrants, on a Swedish bank basket comprising Svenska Handelsbanken, Stadshypotek AB, Sparbanken Sverige and SEBanken, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    500.00 SEK		PREMIUM	13.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     69.20 SEK		 GEARING	7.25 X</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   13.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	20.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  500.00 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
